{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Liminophobia Demo, you'll explore the first level - &quot;Consciousness.&quot; The demo is only available in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;LIMINOPHOBIA&quot; is a game about exploring liminal pools, where each level is not just a visual delight but also a deep dive into thoughts about life, desires, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are no monsters, and no one is chasing you. You can stay underwater for as long as you like.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;LIMINOPHOBIA&quot; features photorealistic environments and realistic water interactions created with Unreal Engine 5 and ray tracing technology, providing a unique immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Consciousness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762600/extras/gif-3.jpg?t=1748895634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your journey in a vibrant and familiar world, where every movement reveals new facets of perception. Explore ordinary yet astonishing landscapes filled with memories and thoughts that shape your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762600/extras/gif-1.jpg?t=1748895634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762600?t=1748895634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762600?t=1748895634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762600/e97ec5217add896eacc52f7a58b3bc1becac6fd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748895634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762600/e97ec5217add896eacc52f7a58b3bc1becac6fd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748895634","categories":[{"description":"Si